Under Routine Use G, the specific condition and limitations are as follows:

* **Condition justifying disclosure:** Information may be provided to contractors and their agents, grantees, experts, consultants, and others performing or working on a contract, service, grant, cooperative agreement, or other assignment for DHS **when necessary to accomplish an agency function related to this system of records** [Page 1, 
](https://arvind-agentic-rag-2026.s3.amazonaws.com/output/chunk_images/DHS-2018-0029-0001_content_1afb3d14-0ece-4eed-8b3f-5a2ce9b698ee.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=AKIA6D6JBUZMSC46T2KY%2F20260814%2Fus-east-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260814T135137Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=9832f762683f1815d7054576dccd58fa054af963142c40634e335b7bee60f8ed).
* **Privacy Act limitations:** Individuals provided information under this routine use are subject to **the same Privacy Act requirements and limitations on disclosure as are applicable to DHS officers and employees** [Page 1, 
](https://arvind-agentic-rag-2026.s3.amazonaws.com/output/chunk_images/DHS-2018-0029-0001_content_1afb3d14-0ece-4eed-8b3f-5a2ce9b698ee.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=AKIA6D6JBUZMSC46T2KY%2F20260814%2Fus-east-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260814T135137Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=9832f762683f1815d7054576dccd58fa054af963142c40634e335b7bee60f8ed).
